# Note Widget — 5 Design Suggestions

**Today:** static read-only rich-text block. Stores `content` (TipTap doc+text),
`appearance` (`plain | info | warn | success`), `overflow` (`clip | scroll`).
No title styling, no icon, no size-responsiveness.

Below are 5 distinct directions it could grow. Each is additive to the current schema.

---

## 1. Sticky Note

Casual pinned-paper feel — dog-eared corner, tinted "paper" color, optional
author/signature line. For quick reminders & personal scribbles, not docs.

```
 ┌──────────────────────────┐
 │  ▒▒ pin ▒▒                │
 │                       ╱│  │   <- dog-eared
 │   Ship the Q3 deck   ╱ │  │      folded corner
 │   before Friday 🚀  ╱──┘  │
 │                          │
 │   — Kalle                │
 └──────────────────────────┘
        paper color: ● yellow ● pink ● blue ● green
```

**Adds:** `paperColor` palette (replaces the callout tints for this style),
`signature` toggle. **Reuses:** `content`.
**Why:** the `info/warn/success` tints already hint at "colored note" — this
makes it a first-class casual surface distinct from formal callouts.

---

## 2. Callout / Admonition

Elevates today's `info/warn/success` into a real doc-style callout: left accent
bar + icon + bold heading + body. The obvious evolution of the current tints.

```
 ┌─┬────────────────────────────┐
 │▌│ 💡  Tip                     │
 │▌│                             │
 │▌│ Press ⌘K to jump to any     │
 │▌│ concept instantly.          │
 └─┴────────────────────────────┘

   variants:  💡 Tip   ℹ️ Info   ⚠️ Warning
              ✅ Success   ⛔ Danger
```

**Adds:** `heading` text, `icon`, expands `appearance` enum (+`tip`,`danger`).
**Reuses:** `appearance` tint logic, `content`.
**Why:** least-effort, highest-polish upgrade — directly reskins what exists.

---

## 3. Document Note (size-responsive)

A real document tile. Title bar w/ icon; at large sizes it splits to show an
auto-generated outline from the note's headings. First Note to read `widgetBox`.

```
 small / medium                    large (>= ~6 tiles wide)
 ┌─────────────────────┐           ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
 │ 📄 Onboarding        │          │ 📄 Onboarding Guide                    │
 ├─────────────────────┤          ├──────────┬─────────────────────────────┤
 │ Welcome to the team. │          │ Outline  │ Welcome to the team.        │
 │ Here's how we work…  │         │ • Intro  │                             │
 │                      │         │ • Tools  │ ## Intro                    │
 │ ## Tools             │         │ • Norms  │ We run on Linear + …        │
 │ We run on Linear…    │         │          │ ## Tools                    │
 └─────────────────────┘           └──────────┴─────────────────────────────┘
```

**Adds:** `showTitle`/icon header, derived outline from `content` headings,
`widgetBox` breakpoint for the two-pane layout. **Reuses:** `content`,`overflow`.
**Why:** turns Note into a knowledge-base surface; outline is free from headings.

---

## 4. Checklist Note

Inline checkboxes inside free text (NOT the Tasks widget — no data binding, just
a personal scratch list) plus a live "x of y done" footer.

```
 ┌────────────────────────────┐
 │ ✎  This week                │
 ├────────────────────────────┤
 │ ☑ Draft dashboard specs     │
 │ ☑ Review Linear sync        │
 │ ☐ Ship the Note widget      │
 │ ☐ Email investors           │
 ├────────────────────────────┤
 │ ▰▰▰▱  2 of 4 done           │
 └────────────────────────────┘
```

**Adds:** task-list mark in the editor + click-to-toggle in render (writes back
into `content`), computed progress footer. **Reuses:** `content` doc.
**Why:** lightweight personal todos without the weight/binding of Tasks.

---

## 5. Banner / Quote

Big centered typography for mottos, mission statements, announcements. Auto-fits
font to tile size; optional attribution. The "loud" Note.

```
 ┌────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │                                          │
 │         “ Make kings,                    │
 │            not courtiers. ”              │
 │                                          │
 │                      — Company motto     │
 │                                          │
 └────────────────────────────────────────┘
       align: ◧ left  ▣ center  ◨ right
```

**Adds:** `display:"banner"`, auto font-scaling via `widgetBox`, `align`,
`attribution`. **Reuses:** `content` (rendered large).
**Why:** dashboards want a hero/headline surface; today Note can't be loud.

---

## At a glance

| # | Suggestion     | New look                | Net-new config                          | Size-aware |
|---|----------------|-------------------------|-----------------------------------------|:----------:|
| 1 | Sticky Note    | tinted paper + dog-ear  | `paperColor`, `signature`               |     –      |
| 2 | Callout        | accent bar + icon head  | `heading`, `icon`, +enum vals           |     –      |
| 3 | Document       | title bar + outline     | header, derived outline                 |     ✓      |
| 4 | Checklist      | toggleable checkboxes   | task-list mark, progress footer         |     –      |
| 5 | Banner / Quote | hero typography         | `align`, `attribution`, font-scale      |     ✓      |

**Lowest lift:** #2 (reskins existing `appearance`). **Highest impact:** #3 / #5.
